---
import { Picture } from "astro:assets";
import josh from "@/images/josh.jpg";
---

<div class="py-8">
  <div
    class="mx-auto grid max-w-7xl grid-cols-1 gap-20 px-6 lg:px-8 xl:grid-cols-3">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-2xl lg:mx-0">
      <h2
        class="text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-pretty text-gray-900 sm:text-5xl dark:text-white">
        Meet Josh
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-6 text-lg/8 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">
        "We" are not a team of consultants or outsourced contractors. "We" are just
        one guy that has been doing this type of work for a long time.
      </p>
    </div>
    <ul
      role="list"
      class="mx-auto grid max-w-2xl grid-cols-1 gap-x-6 gap-y-6 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:mx-0 lg:max-w-none lg:gap-x-8 xl:col-span-2">
      <li>
        <Picture
          src={josh}
          alt="Josh Barnett"
          formats={["avif", "webp"]}
          class="aspect-square w-full rounded-2xl object-cover outline-1 -outline-offset-1 outline-black/5 dark:outline-white/10"
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <h3 class="lg:mt-8 text-lg/8 font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white">
          Josh Barnett, Engineering Leader
        </h3>
        <p class="mt-4 text-base/7 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">
          With over {new Date().getFullYear() - new Date(2007, 2, 10, 0, 0).getFullYear()} years of combined experience as a startup founder, full-stack engineer, and enterprise team leader, I have lead teams of all sizes to their next stages of growth and revenue.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-4 text-base/7 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">
          Whether you&rsquo;re an enterprise team looking to refine your engineering systems and practices or a startup founder in a hurry to launch the right MVP, I&rsquo;m excited to help. Contact me for a free consultation.
        </p>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</div>
